{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026SrQGabeO4K1793178760.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>消委會「消費權益新聞報道獎」頒獎禮，無綫集團新聞部奪得三個獎項。</p><p></p><p>新聞片段旁述︰「在內地網購平台搜尋香港月餅，首個顯示出來的品牌叫『港龍半島』。」</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_J.CONSUMER-1530_001.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026J2cGtejtsP1793178798.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>其中新聞影片獎(短片)金獎由鍾卓熹奪得，報道揭發有內地公司出售聲稱香港品牌的月餅，涉嫌誤導消費者。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_J.CONSUMER 1530.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026awGhLdZZd11793179052.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>《新聞透視》記者楊桂馨就憑有關網購平台出售肉毒桿菌素的調查報道《貪靚貪出禍系列》，獲調查報道銀獎。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_J.CONSUMER-1530_003.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026BRzYxfPNaR1793178813.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>至於壓軸的年度主題大獎，就由《新聞透視》記者李咏潼在內地，實地了解北上安老院生活的專題《北上安老？》奪得。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-28T10:21:40.217345+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":227,"images":4,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-28T07:54:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-28T19:18:08.816087+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-28T10:18:23.020246+00:00","content_hash":"ed90a9a9674c38dec3cd97fa470b89c8360659a8a70e2cce334ff922f4a274d1","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-10-28T10:21:40.217345+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}